  | **ANALYSIS:** If either service has weak configurations, they represent immediate risk regardless of whether an attack is currently in progress.
  | **DECISION:** Run both audits in parallel to establish baseline quickly.
  | **EXPECTATION:** I'll learn the current security levels and decide on hardening actions.

